  "_source": "R2 (11-08 evening). Line 1: analysis/drafts/dim/othersports/final.md hurdles physical column and overall #14 (knock-downs, skill tests); line 2: analysis/drafts/dim/othersports/final.md top 10 #1 (finishes); line 3: hurdles adaptive column and synthesis finding 6 (Opus 0/3 -> 6/6); line 4: dim/adaptive R2 F6 (Gemini, the part kept). Built: hurdles adaptive / engineering columns. Dropped from v1: 'Astra fell by tuning a working runner' (withdrawn in R2: it kept its 4 m/s program on measured rates and fell once). Owner: edit or replace with your analysis.",
  "_status": "draft from the analysis drafts, for the sport owner to edit",
